# When the API serves this app (the Railway setup in DEPLOY.md) you need no
# settings here: requests go to the same address the app is opened from.
#
# Only if the app and the API are hosted separately, set the API's address
# (no /api and no trailing slash), then rebuild:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.up.railway.app
#
# Copy to .env and set the address buyers use to open the app.
# Harvest Passport links, QR codes and printed tags use it, so they work on
# any phone. Leave it unset to use the address the app was opened from
# (that only works for buyers if the app is already on a public address).
VITE_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-farmbok-domain.example
